    "diagnosis": "Carcinoma of unknown primary site reclassified as intrahepatic cholangiocarcinoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<strong>B</strong>&nbsp;BAP1 immunohistochemistry was subsequently performed and demonstrated loss of expression, further supporting this reclassification.",
